      "value": "<p>St Lawrence College is a College of Applied Arts and Technology with three campuses in Eastern Ontario: Brockville, Cornwall, and Kingston. The College has a long history of academic excellence, as it was first established in 1856.</p><p>Around 212 international students are enrolled in courses at the College yearly, in popular courses such as Business Administration and Computer Programming. Situated rurally, the institution prioritises high-quality teaching with good value for money in tuition.</p>",
